// Module c-vertigo-vision: acute vertigo sorted by timing and triggers (TiTrATE), and acute vision
// loss as a triage problem. Builds on f-sensory-visual-vestibular (vertigo, HINTS, visual pathway),
// x-cn-exam (bedside eye exam), c-ms and c-nmosd-mogad (optic neuritis), c-headache (giant cell
// arteritis, idiopathic intracranial hypertension), and c-tia-secondary (amaurosis fugax).

